"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S065", "QuestionID": "QID195"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID196", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is organic food more nutritious than conventionally grown food?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Reviews find no meaningful difference in nutrient content or in health outcomes between organic and conventional produce.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that organic food is much more nutritious than conventionally grown food.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S066", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S066\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID196"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID197", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S066", "QuestionID": "QID197"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID198", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S066", "QuestionID": "QID198"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID199", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does organic farming produce higher yields than conventional farming?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Organic yields are on average lower, typically by about 20 per cent, and the gap varies by crop.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe organic farming produces higher yields than conventional farming.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S067", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S067\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID199"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID2", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 14px;\">Consent to take part in research</div><p>You are invited to take part in a short research study run by Felipe Affonso at Oklahoma State University. You will read forty short questions, each with its documented answer, and answer three quick classification questions about each. It takes about 10 to 12 minutes. Taking part is voluntary and you can stop at any time without penalty. We do not collect your name or anything else that identifies you, and your answers are stored with your Prolific ID only so that we can pay you. There are no risks beyond those of everyday computer use, and no benefit to you other than the payment. You can ask the research team anything about the study through Prolific, and you can contact the Oklahoma State University review board at irb@okstate.edu about your rights as a participant.</p><p style=\"margin-top:16px;font-weight:600;\">Please choose one option below.</p></div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "I agree to take part"}, "2": {"Display": "I do not agree to take part"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "consent", "QuestionID": "QID2"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID20", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S006", "QuestionID": "QID20"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID200", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S067", "QuestionID": "QID200"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID201", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S067", "QuestionID": "QID201"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID202", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Are pesticide residues on ordinary fruit and vegetables at levels that harm people?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Residues measured in national monitoring are far below the levels at which harm is seen in toxicity testing, and dietary exposure assessments built from those measurements find no risk to consumers at ordinary intakes.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the pesticide residues on ordinary fruit and vegetables are at levels that harm people.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S068", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S068\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID202"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID203", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S068", "QuestionID": "QID203"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID204", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S068", "QuestionID": "QID204"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID205", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is nuclear power one of the lowest-carbon ways to generate electricity?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Lifecycle emissions from nuclear sit in the same low range as wind and solar, with a median of about 12 grams of carbon dioxide equivalent per kilowatt hour against about 820 for coal.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that nuclear power is not really a low-carbon source of electricity.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S069", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S069\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID205"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID206", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S069", "QuestionID": "QID206"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID207", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S069", "QuestionID": "QID207"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID208", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Measured as deaths per unit of electricity generated, is nuclear power among the safest ways to generate electricity?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Counting accidents and air pollution together, nuclear causes about 0.03 deaths per terawatt hour of electricity, among the lowest of any source, against about 24 to 25 for coal.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe that per unit of electricity generated, nuclear power is the most dangerous way we generate electricity.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S070", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S070\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID208"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID209", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S070", "QuestionID": "QID209"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID21", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S006", "QuestionID": "QID21"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID210", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S070", "QuestionID": "QID210"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID211", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Can a commercial nuclear power reactor explode like an atomic bomb?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Reactor fuel is far too low in enrichment to produce a nuclear explosion; the physics does not allow it.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that a commercial nuclear power station can explode like an atomic bomb.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S071", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S071\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID211"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID212", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S071", "QuestionID": "QID212"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID213", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S071", "QuestionID": "QID213"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID214", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Did the Fukushima accident kill large numbers of people through radiation?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The United Nations scientific review found no discernible increase in radiation-related illness, and one death has been officially attributed to radiation exposure. The large loss of life that day came from the tsunami, and a further group of deaths, counted in the thousands, is attributed to the evacuation itself rather than to radiation.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that radiation from Fukushima killed thousands of people.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S072", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S072\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID214"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID215", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S072", "QuestionID": "QID215"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID216", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S072", "QuestionID": "QID216"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID217", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Did the Three Mile Island accident cause detectable harm to public health?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The radiation released was small, and long-term epidemiological follow-up of the surrounding population finds no consistent evidence of excess cancer.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe Three Mile Island caused a public health disaster in the surrounding area.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S073", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S073\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID217"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID218", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S073", "QuestionID": "QID218"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID219", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S073", "QuestionID": "QID219"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID22", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is Arctic sea ice shrinking?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. September Arctic sea ice extent has fallen by roughly 12 per cent per decade since satellite records began in 1979.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that Arctic sea ice has recovered and the decline was a myth.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S007", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S007\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID22"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID220", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does living near a nuclear power station raise your cancer risk?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Large studies of populations living around operating plants find no consistent evidence of increased cancer risk from routine operation.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that living near a nuclear power station raises your cancer risk.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S074", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S074\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID220"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID221", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S074", "QuestionID": "QID221"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID222", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S074", "QuestionID": "QID222"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID223", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does a nuclear power station emit carbon dioxide while it generates electricity?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Fission releases no carbon dioxide; the small lifecycle emissions come from construction, mining and fuel processing.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I think a nuclear power station gives off carbon dioxide while it runs, going by what comes out of the cooling towers.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S075", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S075\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID223"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID224", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S075", "QuestionID": "QID224"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID225", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S075", "QuestionID": "QID225"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID226", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does homeopathy work better than a placebo?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The systematic reviews find no reliable evidence that homeopathy is more effective than placebo for any health condition.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that homeopathy works better than a placebo.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S076", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S076\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID226"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID227", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S076", "QuestionID": "QID227"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID228", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S076", "QuestionID": "QID228"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID229", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do detox diets and cleanses remove toxins from the body?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. There is no good evidence that they remove anything; the liver and kidneys do that work continuously.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe detox diets and cleanses flush toxins out of your body.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S077", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S077\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID229"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID23", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S007", "QuestionID": "QID23"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID230", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S077", "QuestionID": "QID230"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID231", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S077", "QuestionID": "QID231"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID232", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do essential oils cure bacterial infections?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. There is no evidence that aromatherapy oils treat bacterial infections, and using them instead of antibiotics is dangerous.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that essential oils can cure a bacterial infection without antibiotics.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S078", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S078\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID232"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID233", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S078", "QuestionID": "QID233"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID234", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S078", "QuestionID": "QID234"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID235", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do multivitamin supplements prevent cancer or heart disease in healthy adults?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Trials in well-nourished adults show no convincing reduction in cancer or cardiovascular disease, and beta carotene raised lung cancer risk in smokers.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that taking a daily multivitamin prevents cancer and heart disease.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S079", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S079\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID235"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID236", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S079", "QuestionID": "QID236"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID237", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S079", "QuestionID": "QID237"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID238", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is a gluten-free diet healthier for people who do not have coeliac disease?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. For people without coeliac disease or a diagnosed sensitivity there is no demonstrated health benefit, and such diets can be lower in fibre.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe going gluten-free is healthier for everyone, not only for people with coeliac disease.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S080", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S080\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID238"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID239", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S080", "QuestionID": "QID239"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID24", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S007", "QuestionID": "QID24"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID240", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S080", "QuestionID": "QID240"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID241", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is monosodium glutamate harmful at the levels found in food?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Controlled studies find no consistent reaction to MSG at dietary levels, and regulators class it as generally recognised as safe.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that MSG in food makes people ill.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S081", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S081\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID241"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID242", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S081", "QuestionID": "QID242"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID243", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S081", "QuestionID": "QID243"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID244", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is aspartame safe at the amounts people actually consume?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. In 2023 the International Agency for Research on Cancer classified aspartame as possibly carcinogenic to humans, its group 2B, a class that records how strong the evidence is that a substance can cause cancer and not how much risk it carries at real intakes. The expert committee that sets intake limits reviewed the same evidence and kept the acceptable daily intake at 40 milligrams per kilogram of body weight, which ordinary consumption is far below.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that aspartame causes cancer at the amounts people normally consume.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S082", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S082\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID244"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID245", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S082", "QuestionID": "QID245"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID246", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S082", "QuestionID": "QID246"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID247", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Gram for gram, is honey a healthier sweetener than table sugar?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. At equal amounts of added sugar the body handles honey and table sugar in much the same way, and the trace nutrients in honey are too small to make a difference to health.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe that gram for gram, honey is a much healthier sweetener than table sugar.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S083", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S083\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID247"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID248", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S083", "QuestionID": "QID248"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID249", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S083", "QuestionID": "QID249"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID25", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Have the world's glaciers been losing ice?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Monitored glaciers have lost mass in almost every year for decades, and the loss has speeded up since 2000.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe glaciers grow and shrink on a natural cycle with no real loss overall.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S008", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S008\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID25"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID250", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do mobile phones cause brain cancer?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Large studies over decades, including the systematic review commissioned by the World Health Organization and published in 2024, find no increased risk of brain tumours from mobile phone use.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that using a mobile phone causes brain cancer.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S084", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S084\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID250"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID251", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S084", "QuestionID": "QID251"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID252", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S084", "QuestionID": "QID252"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID253", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does living near a mobile phone mast harm your health?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Exposure from masts is a small fraction of the international limits, and reviews find no health effects established at the levels the public is exposed to.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe living near a mobile phone mast damages your health.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S085", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S085\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID253"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID254", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S085", "QuestionID": "QID254"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID255", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S085", "QuestionID": "QID255"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID256", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does Wi-Fi damage your DNA?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Wi-Fi is non-ionising radio energy with far too little energy per photon to break chemical bonds in DNA.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that Wi-Fi damages your DNA.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S086", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S086\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID256"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID257", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S086", "QuestionID": "QID257"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID258", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S086", "QuestionID": "QID258"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID259", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do vaccines contain harmful amounts of aluminium?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The aluminium adjuvant in a vaccine is a fraction of a milligram, and modelling by the Food and Drug Administration found that the amount an infant receives from the whole childhood schedule stays below the minimal risk level set for aluminium.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that vaccines contain harmful amounts of aluminium.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S088", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S088\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID259"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID26", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S008", "QuestionID": "QID26"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID260", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S088", "QuestionID": "QID260"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID261", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S088", "QuestionID": "QID261"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID262", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does irradiated food become radioactive?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Food irradiation passes energy through the food and leaves no radioactivity behind.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe irradiated food is left radioactive.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S089", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S089\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID262"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID263", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S089", "QuestionID": "QID263"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID264", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S089", "QuestionID": "QID264"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID265", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is food labelled GMO-free safer than food made from genetically modified crops?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. There is no safety difference; the label describes a production method, not a health property.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that food labelled GMO-free is safer than food made from genetically modified crops.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S090", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S090\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID265"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID266", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S090", "QuestionID": "QID266"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID267", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S090", "QuestionID": "QID267"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID268", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">At equal amounts of added sugar, is high-fructose corn syrup worse for you than ordinary table sugar?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. At equal amounts the two are metabolically very similar; the health concern is the quantity of added sugar of any kind.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that at the same amount of added sugar, high-fructose corn syrup is far worse for you than ordinary table sugar.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S091", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S091\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID268"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID269", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S091", "QuestionID": "QID269"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID27", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S008", "QuestionID": "QID27"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID270", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S091", "QuestionID": "QID270"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID271", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is genetically modified salmon approved for sale unsafe to eat?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The regulator concluded it is as safe to eat and as nutritious as conventional Atlantic salmon.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the genetically modified salmon approved for sale is unsafe to eat.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S092", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S092\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID271"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID272", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S092", "QuestionID": "QID272"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID273", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S092", "QuestionID": "QID273"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID274", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does eating soy lower testosterone in men?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Meta-analyses of clinical trials find no effect of soy foods or soy isoflavones on testosterone in men.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that eating soy lowers testosterone in men.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S093", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S093\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID274"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID275", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S093", "QuestionID": "QID275"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID276", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S093", "QuestionID": "QID276"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID277", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does chiropractic treatment help conditions such as asthma or ear infections?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The evidence supports spinal manipulation mainly for some kinds of low back pain. For asthma, ear infections and other conditions that are not musculoskeletal there is no reliable evidence of benefit.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that chiropractic adjustments can clear up asthma and ear infections.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S094", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S094\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID277"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID278", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S094", "QuestionID": "QID278"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID279", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S094", "QuestionID": "QID279"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID28", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is the ocean becoming more acidic because of carbon dioxide?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. The ocean has absorbed a large share of human carbon dioxide emissions and surface pH has fallen by about 0.1 units since pre-industrial times.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that ocean acidification cannot actually be measured and is only a model prediction.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S009", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S009\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID28"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID280", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do high doses of vitamin C cure cancer?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. High dose vitamin C is not a proven cancer treatment. The randomised trials of high dose oral vitamin C found no survival benefit, and intravenous vitamin C has not been shown in trials to improve survival either.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe high doses of vitamin C can cure cancer.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S095", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S095\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID280"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID281", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S095", "QuestionID": "QID281"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID282", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S095", "QuestionID": "QID282"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID283", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does colloidal silver treat disease?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. It has no proven benefit for any condition and can cause permanent skin discolouration.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that colloidal silver treats infections and other illnesses.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S096", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S096\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID283"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID284", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S096", "QuestionID": "QID284"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID285", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S096", "QuestionID": "QID285"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID286", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is the radiation dose from a dental X-ray large enough to be a meaningful health risk?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The dose from a dental X-ray is a tiny fraction of the natural background a person receives in a year, and the diagnostic benefit far outweighs the very small risk it carries.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that the radiation dose from a dental X-ray is large enough to be a real health risk.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S097", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S097\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID286"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID287", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S097", "QuestionID": "QID287"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID288", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S097", "QuestionID": "QID288"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID289", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is it safer to spread childhood vaccines over a longer schedule?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. There is no evidence of benefit from delaying, and it leaves children unprotected for longer.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe it is safer to spread a child's vaccines over a longer schedule.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S098", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S098\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID289"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID29", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S009", "QuestionID": "QID29"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID290", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S098", "QuestionID": "QID290"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID291", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S098", "QuestionID": "QID291"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID292", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does reiki or energy healing treat illness?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Trials find no reliable clinical benefit beyond placebo.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that reiki and energy healing treat real illness.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S099", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S099\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID292"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID293", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S099", "QuestionID": "QID293"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID294", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S099", "QuestionID": "QID294"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID295", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does drinking ordinary alkaline water change the pH of your blood?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Blood pH is held in a narrow range by the lungs and the kidneys, and drinking ordinary alkaline water does not move it.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that drinking ordinary alkaline water changes the pH of your blood.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S100", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S100\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID295"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID296", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S100", "QuestionID": "QID296"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID297", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S100", "QuestionID": "QID297"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID298", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is the Earth round?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. The Earth is a sphere slightly flattened at the poles, confirmed by navigation, satellites and photographs from space.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the Earth is flat.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S101", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S101\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID298"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID299", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S101", "QuestionID": "QID299"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID3", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px;\">What you will be doing</div><p>On each of the next pages you will see a question that has a documented answer, the answer itself, and a statement someone might make about it. You will answer three quick questions about it.</p><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;\"><b>1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</b> Pick yes when a noticeable share of ordinary people, not only a few specialists, doubts or rejects the answer.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;\"><b>2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the answer?</b> Pick the left or the right when doubt about the answer is more common on that side; pick neither when doubt does not follow politics.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;\"><b>3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</b> Pick yes when the speaker states a belief that the documented answer says is wrong.</p></div><p>You are not being asked whether you agree with the answer. There is no time limit. One page says plainly what to pick, and apart from that page there is no right answer we are checking you against.</p></div>", "QuestionType": "DB", "Selector": "TB", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "instructions", "Validation": {"Settings": {"Type": "None"}}, "QuestionID": "QID3"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID30", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S009", "QuestionID": "QID30"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID300", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S101", "QuestionID": "QID300"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID301", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Did the Apollo astronauts land on the Moon?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Six crewed missions landed between 1969 and 1972, leaving equipment that is still tracked from Earth by laser ranging.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the Apollo Moon landings were staged.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S102", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S102\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID301"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID302", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S102", "QuestionID": "QID302"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID303", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S102", "QuestionID": "QID303"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID304", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does HIV cause AIDS?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. HIV infection destroys immune cells and leads to AIDS if untreated; antiretroviral treatment prevents that progression.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that HIV does not actually cause AIDS.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S103", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S103\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID304"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID305", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S103", "QuestionID": "QID305"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID306", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S103", "QuestionID": "QID306"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID307", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Did the Holocaust kill about six million Jews?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Around six million Jews were murdered, a figure established from German records, transport lists and post-war demographic work.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the figure of six million Jews murdered in the Holocaust is greatly exaggerated.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S104", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S104\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID307"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID308", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S104", "QuestionID": "QID308"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID309", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S104", "QuestionID": "QID309"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID31", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is the recent warming mainly caused by changes in the Sun?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Changes in the Sun are not the main cause of the recent warming. Solar output has been flat or slightly falling since the 1980s while global temperatures rose, so the Sun accounts for at most a small part of the change.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I think the recent warming is driven by the Sun rather than by greenhouse gases.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S010", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S010\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID31"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID310", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Can the injected flu vaccine give you the flu?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The injected vaccine contains no live virus and cannot cause flu; a sore arm and mild aches are the immune response, not an infection.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the injected flu jab gives you the flu.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S105", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S105\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID310"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID311", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S105", "QuestionID": "QID311"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID312", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S105", "QuestionID": "QID312"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID313", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does sugar make children hyperactive?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Controlled trials, including ones where parents were told the child had sugar when they had not, find no effect on behaviour.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that sugar makes children hyperactive.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S106", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S106\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID313"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID314", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S106", "QuestionID": "QID314"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID315", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S106", "QuestionID": "QID315"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID316", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do 5G mobile networks harm health?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. 5G uses non-ionising radio frequencies at exposures well below international limits, and no health effects have been established.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that 5G networks harm people's health.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S107", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S107\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID316"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID317", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S107", "QuestionID": "QID317"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID318", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S107", "QuestionID": "QID318"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID319", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Are the trails left by aircraft a secret chemical spraying programme?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. They are condensation trails, ice crystals that form when hot exhaust meets cold air.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the trails left behind aircraft are a secret chemical spraying programme.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S108", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S108\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID319"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID32", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S010", "QuestionID": "QID32"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID320", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S108", "QuestionID": "QID320"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID321", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S108", "QuestionID": "QID321"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID322", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Did the Sandy Hook school shooting happen?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Twenty children and six staff were killed on 14 December 2012, established by the Connecticut State Police investigation and by the report of the State's Attorney.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that the Sandy Hook school shooting was staged with actors.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S109", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S109\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID322"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID323", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S109", "QuestionID": "QID323"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID324", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S109", "QuestionID": "QID324"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID325", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Were the World Trade Center towers brought down by controlled demolition?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The federal engineering investigation found the collapses were caused by aircraft impact damage and the fires that followed.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the World Trade Center towers were brought down by controlled demolition.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S110", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S110\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID325"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID326", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S110", "QuestionID": "QID326"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID327", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S110", "QuestionID": "QID327"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID328", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is a person in the United States who earns enough to owe federal income tax legally required to pay it?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Courts have rejected every argument that the income tax is voluntary or unconstitutional, and people who acted on those arguments have been convicted.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that even someone who earns enough to owe federal income tax is not legally required to pay it, because the tax is voluntary.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S111", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S111\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID328"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID329", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S111", "QuestionID": "QID329"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID33", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S010", "QuestionID": "QID33"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID330", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S111", "QuestionID": "QID330"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID331", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is fluoride in drinking water at recommended levels safe?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. At the recommended level of about 0.7 milligrams per litre no harm beyond mild dental fluorosis in some children has been established.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the fluoride in tap water is harmful even at the levels they add.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S112", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S112\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID331"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID332", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S112", "QuestionID": "QID332"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID333", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S112", "QuestionID": "QID333"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID334", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does adding fluoride to drinking water reduce tooth decay in children?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Community water fluoridation reduces tooth decay in children. Studies from before fluoride toothpaste was widely used found reductions of about a quarter in decayed, missing and filled teeth, and later studies still find a benefit, though a smaller one.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that fluoridating the water does nothing for tooth decay in children.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S113", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S113\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID334"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID335", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S113", "QuestionID": "QID335"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID336", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S113", "QuestionID": "QID336"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID337", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is the hole in the ozone layer caused by man-made chemicals?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Chlorofluorocarbons and related chemicals destroy stratospheric ozone, which is why the Montreal Protocol banned them and the hole is now shrinking.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that the hole in the ozone layer was natural and not caused by man-made chemicals.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S114", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S114\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID337"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID338", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S114", "QuestionID": "QID338"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID339", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S114", "QuestionID": "QID339"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID34", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do climate scientists broadly agree that recent warming is mostly human-caused?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Surveys of publishing climate scientists and reviews of the published literature both put agreement above 97 per cent, with the exact figure depending on whether the count is of the scientists surveyed or of the papers that state a position.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that scientists are split roughly down the middle on whether the warming is human-caused.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S011", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S011\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID34"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID340", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does secondhand smoke harm non-smokers?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. It causes lung cancer and heart disease in adults and respiratory illness in children, with no safe level of exposure.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe secondhand smoke has never been shown to harm non-smokers.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S115", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S115\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID340"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID341", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S115", "QuestionID": "QID341"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID342", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S115", "QuestionID": "QID342"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID343", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is raw milk safer to drink than pasteurised milk?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Raw milk carries a much higher risk of serious infection from bacteria such as Salmonella, Listeria, Campylobacter and E. coli, which pasteurisation kills.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that raw milk is safer to drink than pasteurised milk.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S116", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S116\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID343"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID344", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S116", "QuestionID": "QID344"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID345", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S116", "QuestionID": "QID345"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID346", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does vitamin C prevent the common cold?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Regular supplements do not stop most people catching colds, though they may shorten a cold slightly.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that taking vitamin C every day stops you catching colds.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S117", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S117\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID346"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID347", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S117", "QuestionID": "QID347"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID348", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S117", "QuestionID": "QID348"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID349", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Were the Egyptian pyramids built by aliens?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. They were built by organised Egyptian labour, with workers' settlements, tools, ramps and pay records excavated at the sites.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the Egyptian pyramids were built by aliens.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S118", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S118\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID349"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID35", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S011", "QuestionID": "QID35"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID350", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S118", "QuestionID": "QID350"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID351", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S118", "QuestionID": "QID351"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID352", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do statins reduce heart attacks in people at high risk?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Randomised trials in tens of thousands of patients show a clear reduction in heart attacks and strokes.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that statins do not actually prevent heart attacks, even in people at high risk.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S119", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S119\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID352"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID353", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S119", "QuestionID": "QID353"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID354", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S119", "QuestionID": "QID354"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID355", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do antidepressants work better than a placebo for adults with moderate or severe depression?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. In adults with moderate or severe depression, antidepressants produce a greater reduction in depression symptom scores than placebo on average, though the size of the benefit varies between drugs and between patients.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that for adults with moderate or severe depression, antidepressants are no better than a placebo.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S120", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S120\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID355"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID356", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S120", "QuestionID": "QID356"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID357", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S120", "QuestionID": "QID357"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID358", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does drinking ordinary coffee raise your overall risk of cancer?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. After reviewing the evidence in 2016 the International Agency for Research on Cancer found the evidence that coffee causes cancer inadequate and removed coffee from its list of possible carcinogens. It classified drinking any beverage at very hot temperatures, not coffee itself, as probably carcinogenic.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe drinking ordinary coffee raises your overall risk of cancer.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S121", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S121\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID358"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID359", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S121", "QuestionID": "QID359"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID36", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S011", "QuestionID": "QID36"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID360", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S121", "QuestionID": "QID360"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID361", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does eating processed meat raise your cancer risk by as much as smoking does?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Processed meat and tobacco are both in group 1 of the cancer agency's classification, which records how certain the evidence is that something can cause cancer and not how much risk it adds. Eating 50 grams of processed meat a day is associated with roughly an 18 per cent higher relative risk of bowel cancer, while smoking multiplies lung cancer risk many times over.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that eating processed meat raises your cancer risk by about as much as smoking does.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S122", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S122\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID361"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID362", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S122", "QuestionID": "QID362"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID363", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S122", "QuestionID": "QID363"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID364", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do sunscreens reduce the risk of skin cancer?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. In a randomised trial with long follow-up, daily sunscreen use reduced squamous cell carcinoma. Melanoma was reduced in the extended follow-up of the same trial, and observational evidence points the same way.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that sunscreen does not prevent skin cancer and may even cause it.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S123", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S123\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID364"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID365", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S123", "QuestionID": "QID365"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID366", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S123", "QuestionID": "QID366"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID367", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does the seasonal flu vaccine reduce the chance of being admitted to hospital with flu?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. In seasons with a good match the vaccine cuts the risk of flu illness and hospital admission substantially, and it reduces severity even when the match is poorer.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the flu vaccine makes no difference to whether you end up in hospital.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S124", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S124\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID367"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID368", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S124", "QuestionID": "QID368"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID369", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S124", "QuestionID": "QID369"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID37", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Have heatwaves become more frequent and more intense?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Hot extremes have become more frequent and more intense over most land regions since the 1950s, and human influence is the main driver.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe heatwaves are no more frequent or intense now than they were decades ago.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S012", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S012\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID37"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID370", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does smoking cause lung cancer?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Smoking causes the large majority of lung cancers and is the leading preventable cause of death worldwide.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that smoking does not really cause lung cancer.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S125", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S125\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID370"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID371", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S125", "QuestionID": "QID371"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID372", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S125", "QuestionID": "QID372"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID373", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do seat belts reduce deaths in car crashes?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Seat belts cut the risk of death for front seat occupants by about half.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that seat belts do not actually save lives in a crash.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</di