 "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S126", "QuestionID": "QID375"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID376", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does the Earth go round the Sun?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. The Earth orbits the Sun once a year, as does every other planet in the solar system.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the Sun goes round the Earth.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S127", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S127\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID376"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID377", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S127", "QuestionID": "QID377"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID378", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S127", "QuestionID": "QID378"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID379", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do antibiotics work against a common cold?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Colds are caused by viruses and antibiotics only work against bacteria.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that antibiotics will clear up a common cold.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S128", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S128\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID379"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID38", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S012", "QuestionID": "QID38"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID380", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S128", "QuestionID": "QID380"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID381", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S128", "QuestionID": "QID381"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID382", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does lead exposure harm children?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Lead damages the developing brain and there is no known safe level of exposure for children.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that low levels of lead do children no harm.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S129", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S129\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID382"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID383", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S129", "QuestionID": "QID383"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID384", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S129", "QuestionID": "QID384"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID385", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">How fast does light travel in a vacuum?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Exactly 299,792,458 metres per second, a value fixed by definition in the international system of units.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that nobody has really pinned down the speed of light and that the figure keeps changing.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S130", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S130\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID385"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID386", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S130", "QuestionID": "QID386"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID387", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S130", "QuestionID": "QID387"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID388", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">What is water made of?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Two hydrogen atoms bonded to one oxygen atom, written H2O.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe water is a substance in its own right rather than hydrogen joined to oxygen.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S131", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S131\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID388"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID389", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S131", "QuestionID": "QID389"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID39", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S012", "QuestionID": "QID39"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID390", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S131", "QuestionID": "QID390"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID391", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do heavy and light objects fall at the same rate in a vacuum?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. With no air resistance all objects accelerate at the same rate, as demonstrated on the Moon with a hammer and a feather.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that heavy objects fall faster than light ones even with no air in the way.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S132", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S132\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID391"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID392", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S132", "QuestionID": "QID392"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID393", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S132", "QuestionID": "QID393"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID394", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">What molecule carries genetic information?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">DNA, which stores the instructions in a sequence of four chemical bases.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that proteins, not DNA, carry the genetic information in our cells.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S133", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S133\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID394"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID395", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S133", "QuestionID": "QID395"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID396", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S133", "QuestionID": "QID396"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID397", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">What causes scurvy?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">A lack of vitamin C in the diet over a period of weeks to months.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe scurvy is caused by poor hygiene rather than by a lack of vitamin C.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S134", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S134\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID397"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID398", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S134", "QuestionID": "QID398"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID399", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S134", "QuestionID": "QID399"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID4", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is the current warming of the planet mostly caused by human activity?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Human activity, mainly the burning of fossil fuels, is responsible for essentially all of the global warming observed since the mid twentieth century.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the warming we are seeing is natural and humans have little to do with it.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S001", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S001\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID4"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID40", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is the carbon dioxide measured at Mauna Loa still going up every year?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. The Keeling Curve has risen every year since measurements began in 1958, reaching an annual average above 420 parts per million.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard the carbon dioxide measured at Mauna Loa has levelled off in recent years.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S013", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S013\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID40"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID400", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">What causes most stomach ulcers?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Most are caused by Helicobacter pylori infection or by long term use of anti-inflammatory painkillers, not by stress or spicy food.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that stomach ulcers are caused by stress and spicy food.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S135", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S135\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID400"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID401", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S135", "QuestionID": "QID401"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID402", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S135", "QuestionID": "QID402"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID403", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does washing your hands reduce the spread of infection?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Hand washing with soap removes germs and lowers rates of diarrhoeal and respiratory illness.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that hand washing makes no real difference to the spread of infection.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S136", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S136\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID403"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID404", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S136", "QuestionID": "QID404"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID405", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S136", "QuestionID": "QID405"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID406", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">How is malaria spread?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Mainly by the bite of an infected female Anopheles mosquito. Rarer routes exist, including blood transfusion, shared needles and transmission from mother to child.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe malaria comes from bad air rather than from mosquito bites.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S137", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S137\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID406"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID407", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S137", "QuestionID": "QID407"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID408", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S137", "QuestionID": "QID408"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID409", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">What causes the ocean tides?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Mostly the gravitational pull of the Moon, with a smaller contribution from the Sun.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the ocean tides are caused by the wind rather than by the Moon.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S138", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S138\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID409"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID41", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S013", "QuestionID": "QID41"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID410", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S138", "QuestionID": "QID410"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID411", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S138", "QuestionID": "QID411"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID412", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do the continents move?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Tectonic plates move a few centimetres a year, which is measured directly by satellite positioning.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that the continents do not actually move.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S139", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S139\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID412"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID413", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S139", "QuestionID": "QID413"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID414", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S139", "QuestionID": "QID414"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID415", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Can you catch a cold from being cold?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Colds are caused by viruses, and being cold does not by itself cause the infection. Colds are more common in winter for several reasons, including more time spent indoors together and changes in how well the airway defends itself in cold dry air.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe you catch a cold from going out in cold weather with wet hair.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S140", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S140\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID415"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID416", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S140", "QuestionID": "QID416"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID417", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S140", "QuestionID": "QID417"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID418", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does regular exercise lower the risk of heart disease?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Regular physical activity lowers the risk of heart disease, stroke, type 2 diabetes and several cancers.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that regular exercise makes no difference to your risk of heart disease.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S141", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S141\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID418"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID419", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S141", "QuestionID": "QID419"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID42", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S013", "QuestionID": "QID42"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID420", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S141", "QuestionID": "QID420"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID421", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Can drinking alcohol during pregnancy harm the baby?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Alcohol crosses the placenta and can cause lifelong physical and cognitive harm; no safe level has been established.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that a little alcohol during pregnancy is perfectly safe for the baby.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S142", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S142\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID421"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID422", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S142", "QuestionID": "QID422"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID423", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S142", "QuestionID": "QID423"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID424", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">What powers the Sun?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Nuclear fusion, mostly hydrogen fusing into helium in the core.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the Sun is a huge ball of burning fuel rather than a fusion reactor.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S143", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S143\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID424"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID425", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S143", "QuestionID": "QID425"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID426", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S143", "QuestionID": "QID426"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID427", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">How many chromosomes does a human normally have?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Forty-six, arranged in 23 pairs.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that humans normally have forty-eight chromosomes.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S144", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S144\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID427"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID428", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S144", "QuestionID": "QID428"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID429", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S144", "QuestionID": "QID429"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID43", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Can the extra carbon dioxide in the air be traced to fossil fuels?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Most of the added carbon dioxide comes from burning fossil fuels, with cement production and land clearing making up the rest. The carbon isotope mix and the falling oxygen content of the atmosphere both show the added carbon comes from these sources.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I think nobody can actually tell where the extra carbon dioxide in the air came from.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S014", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S014\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID43"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID430", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do bacteria become resistant to antibiotics?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Antibiotic use selects for resistant strains, which is why resistance has become a global health problem.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that bacteria do not really become resistant to antibiotics.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S145", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S145\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID430"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID431", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S145", "QuestionID": "QID431"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID432", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S145", "QuestionID": "QID432"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID433", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">What caused the Black Death?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">The bacterium Yersinia pestis, confirmed by DNA recovered from medieval graves, spread mainly by fleas on rodents.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the Black Death was caused by bad air rather than by a bacterium.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S146", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S146\";\n  var