v style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that childhood vaccines cause autism.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S022", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S022\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID67"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID68", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S022", "QuestionID": "QID68"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID69", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S022", "QuestionID": "QID69"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID7", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Has the average temperature at the Earth's surface risen since the late 1800s?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. The global average surface temperature is about 1.1 to 1.2 degrees Celsius warmer than in the late nineteenth century.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard there has been no real rise in global temperature since the late 1800s.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S002", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S002\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID7"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID70", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Is the MMR vaccine safe for children?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. The measles, mumps and rubella vaccine has a long safety record, with serious reactions rare and far less common than the diseases it prevents.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the MMR vaccine is unsafe and was never properly tested.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S023", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S023\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID70"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID71", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S023", "QuestionID": "QID71"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID72", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S023", "QuestionID": "QID72"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID73", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Was the 1998 study that linked MMR to autism sound?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The paper was retracted by The Lancet in 2010 and its lead author lost his medical licence after a finding of dishonesty and unethical conduct.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the 1998 study linking MMR to autism was sound work that got buried.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S024", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S024\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID73"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID74", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S024", "QuestionID": "QID74"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID75", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S024", "QuestionID": "QID75"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID76", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does thimerosal in vaccines cause autism?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Autism rates kept rising after thimerosal was removed from childhood vaccines, and studies find no link.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that the mercury preservative in vaccines is what causes autism.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S025", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S025\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID76"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID77", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S025", "QuestionID": "QID77"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID78", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S025", "QuestionID": "QID78"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID79", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do the mRNA COVID-19 vaccines change your DNA?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. There is no evidence that mRNA vaccines alter human DNA. The mRNA does not enter the cell nucleus, where DNA is kept, it is broken down within days, and human cells have no ordinary route for writing it into DNA.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I think the mRNA COVID vaccines change your DNA.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S026", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S026\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID79"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID8", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S002", "QuestionID": "QID8"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID80", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S026", "QuestionID": "QID80"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID81", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S026", "QuestionID": "QID81"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID82", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do COVID-19 vaccines contain microchips or tracking devices?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. The ingredients are published and contain no electronics of any kind.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the COVID vaccines contain microchips for tracking people.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S027", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S027\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID82"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID83", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S027", "QuestionID": "QID83"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID84", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S027", "QuestionID": "QID84"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID85", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Did COVID-19 vaccination prevent a large number of deaths?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Yes. Modelling studies estimate that vaccination prevented millions of deaths worldwide in the first year alone.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I believe the COVID vaccines did not save any meaningful number of lives.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S028", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S028\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID85"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID86", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S028", "QuestionID": "QID86"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID87", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S028", "QuestionID": "QID87"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID88", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do COVID-19 vaccines cause infertility in women?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Studies of fertility treatment, pregnancy rates and menstrual cycles find no effect on fertility.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that COVID vaccination causes infertility in women.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S029", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S029\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID88"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID89", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S029", "QuestionID": "QID89"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID9", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S002", "QuestionID": "QID9"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID90", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S029", "QuestionID": "QID90"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID91", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does the HPV vaccine cause infertility?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Large safety studies find no effect of HPV vaccination on fertility or on the chance of becoming pregnant.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've read that the HPV vaccine can leave girls infertile.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S030", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S030\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID91"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID92", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S030", "QuestionID": "QID92"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID93", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S030", "QuestionID": "QID93"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID94", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Does the HPV vaccine make teenagers more likely to have sex?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Studies comparing vaccinated and unvaccinated teenagers find no increase in sexual activity or in sexually transmitted infections.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I think giving teenagers the HPV vaccine makes them more likely to start having sex.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S031", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S031\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID94"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID95", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S031", "QuestionID": "QID95"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID96", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">3. Does the statement contradict the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, it contradicts the documented answer"}, "2": {"Display": "No, it does not contradict it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "belief_S031", "QuestionID": "QID96"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID97", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#1F1E1B;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The question</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">Do vaccines cause sudden infant death syndrome?</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">The documented answer</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">No. Studies find no increased risk of sudden infant death after vaccination, and some find a lower risk in vaccinated infants.</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A7F6E;margin:0 0 6px;\">A statement someone might make</div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E0D6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px;\">I've heard that the infant vaccine schedule causes cot deaths.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">1. Do people in the public dispute the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "Yes, a noticeable share of the public disputes it"}, "2": {"Display": "No, almost nobody disputes it"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "item_S032", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var id = \"S032\";\n  var prev = \"\";\n  try { prev = \"${e://Field/shown_ids}\"; } catch (e) { prev = \"\"; }\n  if (!prev || prev.indexOf(\"://Field\") > -1) { prev = \"\"; }\n  try {\n    var g = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\");\n    if (g && String(g).length > prev.length) { prev = String(g); }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  var parts = prev ? prev.split(\",\") : [];\n  if (parts.length === 0 || parts[parts.length - 1] !== id) {\n    parts.push(id);\n  }\n  try { Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"shown_ids\", parts.join(\",\")); } catch (e) {}\n});", "QuestionID": "QID97"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID98", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 4px;color:#1F1E1B;\">2. Which political side, if any, tends to doubt the documented answer?</div>", "QuestionType": "MC", "Selector": "SAVR", "SubSelector": "TX", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "Choices": {"1": {"Display": "People on the political left"}, "2": {"Display": "People on the political right"}, "3": {"Display": "Neither side in particular"}}, "ChoiceOrder": ["1", "2", "3"], "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "ON", "ForceResponseType": "ON", "Type": "None"}}, "Language": [], "DataExportTag": "side_S032", "QuestionID": "QID98"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_STUDY", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID99", "SecondaryAttribute": null, "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weig